ce 120 → gross return = (120‑100)/100 = 0.2. Tests normal profit calculation.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(0)'}], 'expected': 'Num.valueOf(-1)', 'description': 'Entry price 100, final price 0 → gross return = (0‑100)/100 = -1. Tests a total loss scenario.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(0)'}], 'expected': 'NaN', 'description': 'Entry price is 0, final price 0 → division by zero, library should propagate NaN.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(50)'}], 'expected': 'NaN', 'description': 'Entry price is 0, final price 50 → division by zero, expected NaN.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(-30)'}], 'expected': 'Num.valueOf(-1.3)', 'description': 'Entry price 100, final price -30 → gross return = (-30‑100)/100 = -1.3. Tests negative final price handling.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(110)'}], 'expected': 'Num.valueOf(-2.1)', 'description': 'Entry price -100, final price 110 → gross return = (110‑(-100))/(-100) = -2.1. Tests negative entry price.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(100)'}], 'expected': 'Num.valueOf(0)', 'description': 'Entry price 100, final price 100 → no change, gross return should be 0.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'NaN'}], 'expected': 'NaN', 'description': 'Entry price 100, final price NaN → any NaN operand propagates NaN.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(120)'}], 'expected': 'NullPointerException', 'description': 'Entry trade exists but its price per asset is null; calling getPricePerAsset() returns null, causing NPE when delegated.'}, {'input': [{'parameter': 'finalPrice', 'value': 'Num.valueOf(130)'}], 'expected': 'NaN', 'description': 'Both entry price and final price are NaN → result must be NaN.'}]}]
